<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="arial">Dear <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">[client]</span>&nbsp;</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Insperity's Safety Services team provides extensive safety consultation services to help you minimize workers compensation expenses and provide a safe working environment for your employees.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Your safety service team can provide comprehensive safety services at no additional cost to you. Our field Safety Consultants are professionals with qualified experience in safety and risk management; they offer practical solutions to your safety and risk management problems.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Below you will find a few of the available resources within our Safety Services team. You may also review the attached brochure to learn more about these services.</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Safety Evaluation</b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Hazard Identification</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Safety Program Audit</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Safety Program Implementation</b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Basic Safety Program</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Hazard Control Programs</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">•<span style="white-space:pre">	</span>Safety Training</font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b>Get started&nbsp;</b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><b><br></b></font></div><div style=""><font face="arial">Please feel welcome to reach out to me directly if you are interested in contacting your safety consultant.</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
